- **价格位置**：Price_NearSupport_4H, Price_AtResistance_Daily, Price_Extreme_Weekly, etc.
- **周期共鸣**：MTF_Alignment_Bullish (多周期同向), MTF_Conflict_Bearish (周期背离), etc.

